Today is the one year anniversary of my website:

  http://lodockikumazvati.org/

I originally registered the website for one year, not sure if I'd
still be interested in it after that time.  It has become my
favorite domain name.

Registering the website was also the moment I decided to really
commit to learning Lojban--I'd been lurking on the mailing list
for some months before, but not actively involved.

As you can tell by the language this message is written in, I'm
still learning Lojban!  I've been happy being involved in Lojban
for this past year and look forward to continuing to improve my
fluency and continue developing teaching tools.

Thank you everyone!

